    description: Some("Coloured symbols rain down and must be cleared against the clock. Objects move by exchange — fire on one, then on another, and the two trade places, or slide one into an empty space — piling matching shapes until a whole column is identical and vanishes. Bonus pieces can pad a column out, provided a symbol sits at its foot."),
